  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 502.06 Asset management program",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 502.06 “Asset management program” means a systematic process of financing, inventorying, assessing, operating, maintaining, upgrading, and replacing infrastructure cost-effectively while maintaining a sustainable level of service.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1-#3 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 500) #10984, eff 12-1-15; ss by #13511, eff 12-20-22 (formerly Env-Wq 502.05)",
